# BistKA pool of 2026-11-26 (milestones M4 and M6, RQ2/RQ3; validation years 2016-2022 only): the source
# ablation on the locked point-in-time design, config/pit_source_ablation_cashcap.yaml. Four arms (stock
# technical inputs only; + BOT policy rate; + macro proxies; + both, each beside the SET50 ETF market inputs
# except the technical-only arm) at the locked budget of 100k timesteps, seeds 42-46, folds 2016-2022: 140
# tasks. The locked design itself at 100k has all five seeds from the Mac. First come seven tasks that
# retrain the locked design with seed 42 on every fold, to compare BistKA's models with the Mac's
# (~/drl_runs/pit_walk_forward_cash_cap_20261119); then seeds 42-44 of the four arms, then seeds 45-46.
# Operator request in chat, 2026-11-26 23:05: "continue the main progress, submit one job overnight".
